# Retro-Mutation on Bot1's Dryad Arbor (a Land Creature - Forest Dryad): "Enchanted creature is a Turtle" replaces only its
# creature types (CR 205.1b): Dryad goes, Forest stays, and it is still a land creature. "Loses all abilities" (layer 6) takes
# the mana ability its Forest type gives it (CR 305.6, 613.1f), so it can't tap for {G}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Dryad Arbor
Black Lotus
Retro-Mutation
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Dryad Arbor.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Retro-Mutation.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Types = Land; Creature
! Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Activate

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Subtypes = Forest; Turtle
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Toughness = 1
